  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Oh, hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "What took you so long?\\fI’m fining you $100 million!\r",
        "Listen up. I’m going to become\n",
        "the greatest Trainer ever.\r",
        "That’s why I’m here--to toughen\n",
        "up myself and my Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Hehehe! Sorry!\n",
        "I couldn’t help overhearing that.\r",
        "But the greatest Trainer ever?!\n",
        "That’s going to be really tough.\\fBecause you’re talking about me!\r",
        "To prove that, I’m going to the\n",
        "volcano right now.\r",
        "You look puzzled. You really don’t\n",
        "know anything, do you?\r",
        "All right, I’ll tell you.\n",
        "This is the Battle Zone, OK?\r",
        "At the far end, there’s a volcano.\r",
        "And deep inside the volcano, there’s\n",
        "supposed to be a treasure.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: So?\n",
        "What’s the big deal?\r",
        "If I find that treasure first, that’ll\n",
        "make me the greatest Trainer ever?\r",
        "That’s what I’ll do, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "And you too, stranger!\\fI’m gonna get the treasure first!\r",
        "But before that, I’m going to the\n",
        "Battle Tower! See ya!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "That guy...\n",
        "He can’t stay still, can he?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Anyways, howdy, I’m Buck.\n",
        "Sheesh, that punk can’t beat me.\r",
        "So, do you know that zippity-doodah\n",
        "of a Trainer?\r",
        "You should chase after that guy\n",
        "and tell him not to underestimate\\fthe volcano.\r",
        "Oh, but you know what?\r",
        "You’d better shape up at the\n",
        "Battle Tower first, too.\r",
        "I don’t like your chances of getting\n",
        "to the volcano, otherwise.\r",
        "Be seeing you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, Trainer!\n",
        "You have a Pokédex, do you?\r",
        "I bet the person who gave you that\n",
        "is waiting for you to fill that\\fPokédex completely."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, Trainer!\n",
        "You have a Pokédex, do you?\r",
        "Here’s my advice: go out and\n",
        "challenge other Trainers!\r",
        "They’ll often have different Pokémon,\n",
        "so your Pokédex should fill up fast!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "The way the Battle Tower looms...\r",
        "It really is a wall that stands\n",
        "before every Trainer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve battled many Trainers over\n",
        "the years.\r",
        "I’ve gained some confidence in my\n",
        "skill levels, too.\r",
        "But the world is still a huge place.\n",
        "It’s not easy to win in life!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Because of the volcano, the land\n",
        "around here is craggy.\r",
        "The rough terrain and all the ups\n",
        "and downs make it hard to hike."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon League’s Elite Four\n",
        "come here sometimes!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Pokémon are from Sinnoh,\n",
        "aren’t they?\r",
        "They’re not what we’re used to\n",
        "seeing around here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s no end to becoming tough!\r",
        "I just made that up, but it sounds\n",
        "kind of cool, huh?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "What’s up? Do you want to sail to\n",
        "Snowpoint City?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Aye, right!\n",
        "It’s anchors aweigh, then!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, right. You’d rather just fly\n",
        "everywhere in some big hurry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Whenever I go to a new place, I get\n",
        "excited over what I might discover.\r",
        "But places I’ve visited before...\r",
        "Even those places thrill me with\n",
        "new discoveries!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm!\n",
        "A Super Rod is really good!\r",
        "Wouldn’t you agree?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm!\n",
        "We’re of identical minds!\r",
        "Hmm!\n",
        "Take this {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Wherever there’s water, try your\n",
        "luck at fishing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00020",
      "en_US": "Don’t you like to fish?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1213_SC11_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "What’s that?\n",
        "Any advice for fishing?\r",
        "Well, I’ll tell you.\n",
        "It’s all about the rod and technique!"
      ]
    },
    {
